  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "PROFINET SXP: Dissection of PNIO blocks",
  "description": "For a fast proof of concept, dissection of PROFINET IO blocks according to the PROFINET Specification IEC CD 61158-6-10 © IEC:2026 (Version 2.50, Rev14) has not been done for SXP packets and SXP PNIO blocks have been dissected in the packet-pn-sxp.c directly. This changeset now properly dissects all PNIO blocks (SXP and non-SXP alike) in one file.\n\nThis implementation reflects IEC CD 61158-6-10 © IEC:2026 Version 2.50 Rev14. Updates to match IEC CD 61158-6-10 © IEC:2026 Version 2.50 Rev17 will follow.\n\nAI-Assisted: yes \\[GH Copilot\\]",
